    "name": "Selected translated abstracts of Russian-language climate-change publications: III. Aerosols",
    "description": [
      "This report presents abstracts (translated into English) of important Russian-language literature concerning aerosols as they relate to climate change. In addition to the bibliographic citations and abstracts translated into English, this report presents the original citations and abstracts in Russian. Author and title indexes are included to assist the reader in locating abstracts of particular interest."
